              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-sans text-sm font-bold text-chocolate uppercase tracking-wide">
                PayPal
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-marron mt-0.5">
                Tarjeta o cuenta PayPal
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="bg-white border-l-4 border-l-chocolate rounded-lg shadow-sm p-5"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-chocolate/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold text-chocolate shrink-0">
              BBVA
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-sans text-sm font-bold text-chocolate uppercase tracking-wide">
                Transferencia Bancaria
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-marron mt-0.5">
                México — CLABE: 0074 3521 0015 6655 1081
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="bg-white border-l-4 border-l-oro/40 rounded-lg shadow-sm p-5 opacity-70"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-oro/5 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-lg shrink-0">
              ₿
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-sans text-sm font-bold text-chocolate uppercase tracking-wide">
                Bitcoin
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-marron mt-0.5">
                Próximamente — Dirección de Bitso
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <div class="bg-oro/5 border border-oro/20 rounded-xl p-8 md:p-12">
        <p class="font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl text-chocolate italic leading-relaxed mb-6">
          "Cuando el ser humano muere, sus obras se interrumpen excepto tres:
          la caridad continua, el conocimiento que beneficia, o un hijo recto
          que ruega por él." (Muslim)
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-marron leading-relaxed">
          Tu donación es una inversión para tu ākhirah. Cada vez que alguien
          rece en esta musala, estudie en ella o encuentre guía, la recompensa
          llegará a ti, por voluntad de Allāh.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-gris-claro">
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-chocolate mb-4">
        Comparte esta causa
      </h3>
      <div class="flex justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/?text=Apoya%20la%20Musala%20-%20https://web-khaled.vercel.app/donar"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="bg-chocolate text-white w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-granate transition-colors no-underline font-bold text-lg"
        >W</a>
        <a
          href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://web-khaled.vercel.app/donar"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="bg-chocolate text-white w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-granate transition-colors no-underline font-bold text-lg"
        >F</a>
        <a
          href="https://x.com/intent/tweet?url=https://web-khaled.vercel.app/donar&text=Apoya%20la%20Musala"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="bg-chocolate text-white w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-granate transition-colors no-underline font-bold text-lg"
        >X</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
